# Save this file as ".htaccess" in the AFS directory you want to protect.
# Restricts access to any authenticated Stanford affiliate.
#
# Pair with these AFS ACLs on the same directory:
#   fs sa . system:www-servers read
#   fs sa . system:anyuser none
#
# NOTE: keep a trailing newline after the last directive or it may be ignored.

AuthType WebAuth
require privgroup stanford:stanford
